---
kind: lore
id: mid.route11
title: Route 11, the Fen Walk (Wardenmere to Fairhaven)
---

// Route 11 follows the boardwalks along the edge of the Wildmoor fens from
// Wardenmere to Fairhaven. Maela swims by day only; the old angler hands out
// the Super Rod once (east's Old Ned gives the Good Rod; merge fix, see NOTES "Merged").

<beat id="arrive" on="enterRoute" target="route.r11" title="The Fen Walk" priority="10" once="run">
  ::bg{location="route-11" time="day"}
  ::music{action="change" mood="calm" volume="normal"}
  @narrator{code="0010"}: Boardwalks over black water, reeds higher than your head, and the smell of peat. To the north, the Wildmoor Preserve fence; to the south, the lights of Fairhaven.
  @narrator{code="0020"}: Every few planks, a fisherman. None of them have caught anything. All of them are happy about it.
</beat>

<entry id="midR11Morning" on="enterRoute" target="route.r11" category="bark" once="day" when="@isMorning">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: Fog lies on the fens like a blanket. Somewhere under it, a Flopfish flops.
</entry>

<entry id="midR11Day" on="enterRoute" target="route.r11" category="bark" once="day" when="run.slot == 'day'">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: The fens steam in the sun. Maela is doing lengths of the big pool, and the fishermen are pretending not to mind.
</entry>

<entry id="midR11Night" on="enterRoute" target="route.r11" category="bark" once="day" when="@isNight">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: Marsh lights drift over the water at night. The fishermen say they are only gas. The fishermen go home early.
</entry>

<entry id="midR11Sign" on="talk" target="npc.r11Signpost" category="bark">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: ROUTE 11 — THE FEN WALK. Fairhaven ahead. Wildmoor Preserve entrance: back in Wardenmere. Stay on the boards.
</entry>

<beat id="oldAnglerRod" on="talk" target="npc.r11OldAngler" title="Old Angler Fenwick" priority="10" once="run">
  @r11OldAngler{code="0010"}: Forty years I've fished this fen. Forty years, and never once caught what I was fishing for. Best forty years of my life.
  @r11OldAngler{code="0020"}: You look like you'd enjoy not catching things too. Here. It's a good rod. Better than good: it's called the Super Rod.
  ::give{item="superRod"}
  @narrator{code="0010"}: {{userName}} received the Super Rod!
</beat>

<entry id="midR11OldAnglerAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r11OldAngler" category="bark">
  @r11OldAngler{code="0010"}: Catch anything? No? Good. Keeps you coming back.
</entry>

<entry id="midR11OldAnglerMorning" on="talk" target="npc.r11OldAngler" category="bark" priority="5" once="day" when="@isMorning">
  @r11OldAngler{code="0010"}: Morning's the time. The Goldfinn bite before the fog lifts. Or they would, if I could see them.
</entry>

// ── trainers ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r11FishermanBram" who="r11FishermanBram" intro="Hey! You scared off my Flopfish! That was going to be the one!" win="It wasn't going to be the one." lose="Now the fish can come back." prize="560" instance="use-001"/>

<entry id="midR11FishermanBramAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r11FishermanBram" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['r11FishermanBram'])">
  @r11FishermanBram{code="0010"}: Fenwick up the boardwalk gives rods away. He gave me one twelve years ago. I still haven't caught anything with it. Great rod.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r11FishermanWillem" who="r11FishermanWillem" intro="A trainer! On MY plank! Only one thing for it!" win="Take the plank. I'll find another plank." lose="My plank. Mine." prize="600" instance="use-002"/>

<entry id="midR11FishermanWillemAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r11FishermanWillem" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['r11FishermanWillem'])">
  @r11FishermanWillem{code="0010"}: Down south of Fairhaven there's a giant asleep across the road. Been there longer than my plank. Ashby the hermit says only music will wake it.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r11SwimmerMaela" when="!@isNight" who="r11SwimmerMaela" intro="Fen water's the best for training. Nobody else dares get in!" win="I'm getting out. I'm cold. That's the only reason." lose="Splash! That's the sound of you losing." prize="440" instance="use-003"/>

<entry id="midR11SwimmerMaelaAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r11SwimmerMaela" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['r11SwimmerMaela']) && !@isNight">
  @r11SwimmerMaela{code="0010"}: You can't surf here without a disc and the Venom Badge. Kessler's rule. He says it's safety. I say he just likes people asking him.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r11BugCatcherPip" who="r11BugCatcherPip" intro="I came second in the contest last Saturday! Second best in the whole Preserve!" win="Third best now. At least." lose="Still second best! Somewhere!" prize="280" instance="use-004"/>

<entry id="midR11BugCatcherPipAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r11BugCatcherPip" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['r11BugCatcherPip'])">
  @r11BugCatcherPip{code="0010"}: The judges love Hornbeetles and Bladebugs. They're rare in the Preserve. A Papillume or a Waspire gets you a ribbon. A Cocoonix gets you a pat on the head.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r11BreederHilde" who="r11BreederHilde" intro="I raised every one of my monsters from an egg at the Fairhaven day care! Say hello to the family!" win="Oh, you poor dears. Mummy's proud anyway." lose="Good babies! Very good babies!" prize="720" instance="use-005"/>

<entry id="midR11BreederHildeAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r11BreederHilde" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['r11BreederHilde'])">
  @r11BreederHilde{code="0010"}: Tobbe and Ilse at the day care have lost one of their lodgers. A Mothfuzz. Ilse's beside herself. Keep an eye out, would you?
</entry>
